                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "LINKS-gen_Zeeland_2017_01 contains life course and family reconstructions for all individuals who were born, married, or died within the Zeeland province. The dataset is based on the indexed Zeeland civil certificates as provided by WieWasWie (WWW) in December 2016.\n<br><br>\n<b>Before using the data it is imperative to study the documentation. </b>"
